        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Rato Roliço. Bidoof tem nervos de aço e é mais ágil do que parece. Ele rói troncos e pedras com os dentes da frente para construir ninhos perto da água.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/4 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo, Água 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Bidoof pode evoluir para Bibarel no nível 5 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Growl, Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Defense Curl</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Rollout</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Headbutt</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Hyper Fang</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Yawn</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Crunch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Take Down</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Super Fang</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Swords Dance</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Amnesia</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Curse, Superpower</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Aqua Tail, Attract, Blizzard, Charge Beam, Confide, Covet, Double Team, Echoed Voice, Facade, Frustration, Grass Knot, Hidden Power, Ice Beam, Icy Wind, Iron Tail, Last Resort, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Rock Smash, Round, Shadow Ball, Shock Wave, Sleep Talk, Snore, Stealth Rock, Substitute, Sunny Day, Super Fang, Superpower, Swagger, Swift, Swords Dance, Taunt, Thief, Thunder, Thunder Wave, Thunderbolt, Toxic, Work Up</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Aqua Tail, Defense Curl, Double-Edge, Endure, Fury Swipes, Mud Sport, Odor Sleuth, Quick Attack, Rock Climb, Rollout, Skull Bash, Sleep Talk, Water Sport</p>",
